WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.680
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:08.960
Dr. Bright is not permitted to try and&nbsp;
solve every single problem with chainsaws.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.720
Chainsaws can be quite helpful when&nbsp;
it comes to certain specific tasks!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.560
They’re great at, for instance, speedily&nbsp;
chopping up lumber or menacing a group of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.080
unsuspecting teenagers on a road trip.&nbsp;
However, Dr. Bright would like you to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.960
believe that the application of chainsaws&nbsp;
goes far beyond the realm of reason or safety.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:31.840
Chainsaws should not be used: To trim your hair,&nbsp;
to contain SCP-682, to cut a sandwich, or as the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:36.880
ammunition in a specialized cannon. It was fine&nbsp;
the one time at the company Christmas Party,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:44.080
we all had a good laugh, but Doctor Jones will&nbsp;
never get his big toe back. No more chainsaws!

